1117	    /// note ends up at SATB slot `voice_position`. Used by block-voicing
1118	    /// modes (BarryHarris, FunctionalHarmony, BachChorale) which produce
1119	    /// a fixed voicing without natively respecting voice_position.
1120	    ///
1420	                        "[AUTOKEY] key change: {:?} -> {:?} (note={}, releasing {} stale)",
1421	                        self.key,
